{
  "_comment": "L2 clarify-gate contract. The gate is deterministic (no model), it fires on ~17% of the ffmpeg corpus in the native runtime, and nothing previously proved Python's equivalent fires on the same rows. Given (utterance, plan, registry) both runtimes must produce the same post-gate payload: the plan with chain intermediates bound to their producer, or a single clarify step. Consumed by python/core/tests/test_clarify_gate_parity.py and `clarify_gate_parity_cases` in native/crates/knaif-core/tests/parity.rs.",
  "_stage": "The stage is `link_chain_intermediates -> hallucinated-filename guard`, in that order. Python composes it in CommandAgent.infer; native in knaif_core::apply_clarify_gate. Comparing either half alone would violate Rule 2.",
  "_expected_values": "Produced by the reference runtime (Python CommandAgent._link_chain_intermediates then ._hallucinated_filename). DO NOT regenerate to make a failing test pass.",
  "_coverage": {
    "ubuntu": "CI",
    "windows": "local",
    "macos": "unexercised"
  },
  "registries": {
    "demo": "resize_video:\n  description: \"Resize a video.\"\n  required_args: [inputs]\n  optional_args: [height, output]\nstrip_audio:\n  description: \"Remove the audio track.\"\n  required_args: [inputs]\n  optional_args: [output]\nconcat_video:\n  description: \"Join several videos.\"\n  required_args: [inputs]\n  optional_args: [output]\ninspect_video:\n  description: \"Report a video's properties.\"\n  required_args: [inputs]\nwatermark_video:\n  description: \"Stamp a watermark on a video.\"\n  required_args: [inputs]\n  arg_schemas:\n    output: {type: string, help: \"where to write it\"}\nclarify:\n  description: \"Ask the user one question.\"\n  required_args: [question]\nreject:\n  description: \"Refuse the request.\"\n  required_args: [reason]\ndone:\n  description: \"Nothing to do.\"\n"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "single_step_named_file_untouched",
      "registry": "demo",
      "utterance": "resize clip.mp4 to 720p",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_payload": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "chain_intermediate_is_linked_to_its_producer",
      "registry": "demo",
      "utterance": "strip the audio from clip.mp4 and resize it to 720p",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "strip_audio",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip_silent.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_payload": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "strip_audio",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ],
              "output": "clip_silent.mp4"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip_silent.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hallucinated_input_downgrades_to_clarify",
      "registry": "demo",
      "utterance": "resize the video to 720p",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "holiday.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_payload": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "clarify",
            "args": {
              "question": "You didn't mention 'holiday.mp4' in your request — which file should I work on?"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "invented_output_name_is_allowed",
      "registry": "demo",
      "utterance": "resize clip.mp4 to 720p",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720,
              "output": "whatever.mp4"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_payload": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "resize_video",
            "args": {
              "inputs": [
                "clip.mp4"
              ],
              "height": 720,
              "output": "whatever.mp4"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
